# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Training output policy (see CLAUDE.md §5)
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# adapter_model.safetensors / adapter_config.json / training_args.bin /
# train_results.json / all_results.json / trainer_state.json /
# training_loss.png / eval_loss.png  → NOT ignored; may be added explicitly
# after user-approved training milestone.
#
# Everything else inside outputs/ is large or duplicate and is blocked.

# Intermediate checkpoints (resume-only; large)
training_models/outputs/**/checkpoint-*/

# Optimizer / scheduler / RNG state (resume-only; large)
training_models/outputs/**/optimizer.pt
training_models/outputs/**/scheduler.pt
training_models/outputs/**/rng_state.pth
training_models/outputs/**/scaler.pt
training_models/outputs/**/global_step*

# Tokenizer / processor duplicates auto-copied by LLaMA-Factory
# (bit-identical to the base Qwen3-VL tokenizer; ~15 MB per adapter)
training_models/outputs/**/tokenizer.json
training_models/outputs/**/tokenizer_config.json
training_models/outputs/**/special_tokens_map.json
training_models/outputs/**/added_tokens.json
training_models/outputs/**/vocab.json
training_models/outputs/**/merges.txt
training_models/outputs/**/chat_template.jinja
training_models/outputs/**/processor_config.json
training_models/outputs/**/preprocessor_config.json
training_models/outputs/**/README.md
